1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,450
Ronaldo 15 yoshida futbolni butunlay
tashlashiga to‘g‘ri kelishi mumkin edi.

2
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:07,300
Bugun millionlab muxlislarga ega futbolchi

3
00:00:07,340 --> 00:00:10,300
o‘smirligida yurak bilan bog‘liq
muammoga duch kelgan.

4
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:14,200
Shifokorlar unda yurakning haddan
tashqari tez urishini aniqlashgan.

5
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:18,160
U muolajadan o‘tgan va ko‘p o‘tmay
yana mashg‘ulotlarga qaytgan.

6
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:21,320
Keyinchalik Manchester United, Real Madrid

7
00:00:21,320 --> 00:00:24,300
va Portugaliya terma jamoasi bilan
tarixiy yutuqlarga erishgan.

8
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:27,800
Eng qizig‘i, bir paytlar sog‘lig‘i
xavotir uyg‘otgan bola

9
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:31,280
futbol tarixidagi eng mashhur
sportchilardan biri bo‘ldi.

10
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:35,020
Sizningcha, Ronaldo kuchlimi yoki Messi?
